[ ] Script the specification release $Write scripts/release <version> to do the mechanical release steps. It refuses when a commit since the last tag changed spec files without a changelog entry. Darrion still picks the version and decides to publish. Adoption happens in the same session: Core declares the new version and the platform pins both.$ ^2026-10-13T07:54 #01a13441-b0e0-7ea1-9deb-eadc13a16cf1
